WEBVTT

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:30.962
between stasis and creativity.

00:14:31.633 --> 00:14:33.664
And in this war,

00:14:33.688 --> 00:14:38.016
our side is not destined to lose.

00:14:38.593 --> 00:14:45.395
If we choose to apply our unique
capacity to create explanatory knowledge,

00:14:45.419 --> 00:14:47.394
we could win.

00:14:48.175 --> 00:14:49.325
Thanks.

00:14:50.095 --> 00:14:56.595
(Applause)